{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>FEAR TAKES SHAPE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990290/extras/8c4c38d148c56d22bcace8fe99db4115.poster.avif?t=1773863421\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990290/extras/8c4c38d148c56d22bcace8fe99db4115.webm?t=1773863421\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990290/extras/8c4c38d148c56d22bcace8fe99db4115.mp4?t=1773863421\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <strong>when you realize the most terrifying enemy is\u2026 yourself.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This first-person indie horror game blends atmosphere, psychological tension, and unpredictable scares to immerse you in a world where darkness is alive. Explore claustrophobic environments, uncover unsettling mysteries, and face the constant dread of your own shadow stalking you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990290/extras/ded55b20559700fe16ab565e1d67b184.poster.avif?t=1773863421\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990290/extras/ded55b20559700fe16ab565e1d67b184.webm?t=1773863421\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990290/extras/ded55b20559700fe16ab565e1d67b184.mp4?t=1773863421\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between solving puzzles and surviving nerve-wracking chases, every step will test your  <br>courage. The soundscape, visuals, and lighting are carefully designed to make you question what\u2019s real\u2014and what\u2019s waiting in the dark. <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f <strong>First-Person Horror</strong> \u2013 Fear up close, as if you were there.<br>\ud83c\udf11 <strong>Your Own Shadow as the Enemy</strong> \u2013 A unique twist on terror.<br>\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Challenging Puzzles</strong> \u2013 Unlock paths through tension-filled mysteries.<br>\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Intense Jumpscares</strong> \u2013 Crafted for genuine reactions.<br>\ud83c\udfa7 <strong>Immersive Atmosphere</strong> \u2013 Audio and visuals built to unsettle.<br>\ud83d\udd2a <strong>Evolving Experience</strong> \u2013 Expanded content throughout Early Access.<br><br><strong></strong><br><strong>Are you ready to face what hides in your shadow?</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3990290?t=1773863421","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990290/cf29cd5bbd9b87ac653b2cfca023ccd9a0fda9ac/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773863421","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990290/4fc93418631c0c6b4eca1003abf25894bf41a7b1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773863421","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990290/4fc93418631c0c6b4eca1003abf25894bf41a7b1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773863421","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>FEAR TAKES SHAPE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990290/extras/8c4c38d148c56d22bcace8fe99db4115.poster.avif?t=1773